  m_text: '<color=blue>Fire Spell</color> destroys crops and lights the <color=blue>cauldron</color>

    <color=blue>Ground
    Spell</color> tills soil and <color=blue>mines rocks</color>

    <color=blue>Water
    Spell</color> waters crops and <color=blue>fishes</color>

    <color=blue>Air
    Spell</color> harvests crops and <color=blue>shakes bushes</color>'
